{"ID":"20240205153712-mndws75","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153712-mndws75","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153712-mndws75\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091710-fflf029\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614115914-sy923cj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1038,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240618113006-40ym995\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"374补17三七（田七）","type":"doc","updated":"20240828142935"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206091710-fflf029","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091710-fflf029","updated":"20240206091714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于云南文山、广西、江西、四川等地。\n【性状】\t主根呈类圆锥形或圆柱形，长16cm，直径14cm。表面灰黄色或灰褐色，有断续的纵皱纹及支根痕。顶端有茎痕，周围有瘤状突起。体重，质坚实，断面灰绿色、黄绿色或灰白色，皮部与木质部较易分离，木部微呈放射状排列。气微，味苦回甜。\n【性味】\t甘、微苦，温。\n【功效】\t止血；散血；定痛。主治跌扑瘀肿，胸痹绞痛，症瘕；血瘀经闭；痛经；产后瘀阴腹痛；疮痈肿痛。\n【注解】\t“铜皮”指三七药材的外皮呈灰黄色，像金属铜的颜色。\n“铁骨”指药材内部中心的颜色像铁色，质地坚硬如骨，体重坚实而不易折断。\n“丁头”指三七药材上部生有的瘤状隆起的支根痕。"}]},{"ID":"20240206091700-5226u72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091700-5226u72","updated":"20240206091700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206091700-qgh11ep.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162656-8b2qkr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162656-8b2qkr0","updated":"20240205162656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三七"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三七-20240205162656-o02jdsr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240618113006-40ym995","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618113006-40ym995","updated":"20240828142725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 425px;","style":"width: 415px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三七1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三七1-20240704163028-kgiuxqa.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 415px;\" parent-style=\"width: 425px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 478px;","style":"width: 468px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三七7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三七7-20240704163712-hxt7dfn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 468px;\" parent-style=\"width: 478px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240704163213-v1ctlyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704163213-v1ctlyp","updated":"20240828142727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 535px;","style":"width: 525px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三七3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三七3-20240704163242-ulvj4vq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 525px;\" parent-style=\"width: 535px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 561px;","style":"width: 551px;"},"Children":[{